functional Requirements:
 
                  Project Name -  studenthub portal

Objective:
StudentHub Portal is a web application designed to help students manage their academic activities efficiently.

User Roles:

 (1) Student:
Register Account
Login
View Dashboard
View Courses
View Attendance
View Results
Submit Feedback
Update Profile

(2)Admin:
Manage Students
Manage Courses
Manage Attendance
Manage Results
View Student Feedback

Functional Modules:

1. Home

Welcome Page
Navigation Bar
StudentHub Introduction

2. Assignment

View Assignment
Assignment Details
Submission Date

3. Attendance

View Attendance Percentage
Subject-wise Attendance

4. Contact
Contact Form
College Information

5. Course
View Available Courses
Course Description

6. Dashboard
Quick Overview
Navigation Cards

7. Login
Username
Password
Authentication

8. Profile
Student Details
Update Information

9. Register
Create New Account

10. Result
Subject Marks
Grade
CGPA

11. Student Feedback
Give Feedback
Rate College Services
